  "body_html": "<p>¿Cómo estás?</p><p>Soy Aina y esto es Think&amp;Hack.</p><p>Cinco semanas. Tres archivos de contexto. <strong>Y hoy, el paso final</strong>: ensamblar todo en un sistema que funciona.</p><p><strong>Esta es la última entrega de la serie.</strong></p><p>Si te interesa lo práctico, suscríbete para no perderte nada.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Suscríbete ahora&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Suscríbete ahora</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>📚 <strong>Esta es la parte 5 de 5 de la serie “Sistema de escritura con IA”</strong></p><ol><li><p>  <a href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/borrar-memoria-chatgpt\">Por qué borré la memoria de ChatGPT</a> ← Reset</p></li><li><p>  <a href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/10-el-metodo-para-que-tu-ia-hable\">El método para que tu IA hable como tú</a> ← Voz</p></li><li><p><strong>  </strong><a href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/11-para-quien-escribe-tu-ia-si-no\">Para quién escribe tu IA</a> ← Audiencia</p></li><li><p><strong> </strong> <a href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/perfil-negocio-chatgpt\">Cómo entreno a ChatGPT para mi negocio</a> ← Negocio</p></li><li><p><strong>  <a href=\"https://ainalluna.substack.com/p/proyectos-chatgpt-sistema\">Proyectos en ChatGPT: El sistema completo</a> ← Integración</strong></p></li></ol><div><hr></div><h2>El problema de tener archivos sueltos</h2><p>Probablemente tienes los tres JSON guardados en alguna carpeta. Y cada vez que quieres usarlos:</p><ol><li><p>Abres ChatGPT</p></li><li><p>Creas un chat nuevo</p></li><li><p>Arrastras los tres archivos</p></li><li><p>Esperas que se carguen</p></li><li><p>Empiezas a escribir</p></li></ol><p><strong>Funciona. Pero es fricción innecesaria.</strong></p><pre><code>Y hay otro problema: si usas la memoria nativa de ChatGPT (la que borramos en la newsletter #9), el modelo mezcla lo que le dijiste en otros chats con el contexto de tus archivos.</code></pre><p>Necesitas un espacio aislado donde ChatGPT solo sepa lo que tú le has dicho explícitamente.</p><p>Ese espacio existe. Se llama <strong>Proyectos</strong>.</p><div><hr></div><h2>Qué es un Proyecto (y por qué lo cambia todo)</h2><p><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10169521-projects-in-chatgpt\">Un Proyecto es un espacio de trabajo independiente dentro de ChatGPT</a>. Tiene memoria aislada, archivos persistentes, e instrucciones personalizadas que aplican a todos los chats dentro del proyecto.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:794,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:4380077,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Qué es un proyecto en chatgpt&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/181661791?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Qué es un proyecto en chatgpt\" title=\"Qué es un proyecto en chatgpt\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fae292ab9-3026-4bdf-83b4-eb4533835781_2816x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Qué es un proyecto en chatgpt</figcaption></figure></div><pre><code>Tu ADN Verbal + tu PCI + tu Perfil de Negocio + instrucciones = <strong>un sistema que ya sabe quién eres cada vez que abres un chat.</strong></code></pre><p>Más sobre proyectos: <strong><a href=\"https://ainalluna.com/blog/proyectos-en-chatgpt-organiza-tu-trabajo-y-maximiza-tu-productividad-con-ia\">Proyectos en ChatGPT: Organiza tu trabajo y maximiza tu productividad con IA</a></strong></p><div><hr></div><h2>Tu Proyecto de escritura en ChatGPT</h2><p>Un proyecto llamado “Sistema de Escritura” (o como quieras) que contenga:</p><ul><li><p>Tus tres archivos JSON subidos permanentemente</p></li><li><p>Instrucciones que le dicen a ChatGPT cómo usar esos archivos</p></li><li><p>Un espacio limpio donde cada chat nuevo ya tiene todo el contexto</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:630,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:202772,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Cómo usar los Proyectos en ChatGPT para marketing&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://ainalluna.substack.com/i/181661791?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Cómo usar los Proyectos en ChatGPT para marketing\" title=\"Cómo usar los Proyectos en ChatGPT para marketing\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!87P5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ba71a53-d057-423b-9d0d-3ccbeac2bae4_1200x630.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><strong>Cómo usar los Proyectos en ChatGPT para marketing</strong></figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h2>Cómo crear tu Proyecto en ChatGPT</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Paso 1</strong>: Ve a chatgpt.com → Proyectos → Crear nuevo proyecto</p></li><li><p><strong>Paso 2</strong>: Sube tus tres archivos (voice-dna.json, pci.json, perfil-negocio.json)</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Kg3Z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png\" width=\"1037\" height=\"712\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4085eea8-166e-44a9-87fc-b3876679e762_1037x712.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:712,&quot;width&quot;:1037,&